SUMMARY:Impromptu: LV Rapturous Ride (20F)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nEvening Road Ride startin
 g from Landis Valley Farm Museum. Join me as we preview a TdRR ride.\n\nAn
 ticipated Average Pace: 11-12 mph\n\nRide leader: Jon Hartung\nSweep: Volu
 nteer to sweep\n\nRoute:\n[https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/lv-rap
 turous-ride-20f-2/](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/lv-rapturous-
 ride-20f-2/)\n\nThe ride leader will ride at the advertised average speed.
  This is intended to be a group ride with a no-drop rule as the main goal.
  The ride leader will do his/her best to keep the group together with occa
 sional regroupings and a sweeper may also be appointed at the start. Pleas
 e do not join this ride if you are not willing to ride with the group. If 
 you exceed the posted pace\, you will be riding by yourself and encouraged
  to join a faster group.\n\nIf maintaining a 11-12 mph average is beyond y
 our current ability level\, please consider joining a slower ride first.\n
 \nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water and a basic repair
  kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo eliminate passi
 ng around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membership and Meet
 up RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a c
 lub member.\n\nJoin @ Lancasterbikeclub.net -Member Signup. Your RSVP is y
 our agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct: Code of Conduct Guid
 ance if an incident occurs: Incident Actions
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3153865
 77/
